  "description": "High-performance, allocation-conscious messaging for .NET 10. A length-prefixed binary protocol with RPC, Pub/Sub, Streaming and Batching, built on System.IO.Pipelines, over TCP, Unix domain sockets, named pipes or shared memory. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
